WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.478
Step 1. Open the Immunizations tab of the encounter.

1.2
00:00:03.478 --> 00:00:06.395
You record a dose that the schedule recommends,

1.3
00:00:06.395 --> 00:00:11.426
so Care links the record to that recommendation and can mark it Complete.

2.1
00:00:11.426 --> 00:00:14.985
Step 2. Find the recommendation in the schedule.

2.2
00:00:14.985 --> 00:00:18.914
Under Schedule, find the row of the vaccine and the dose.

2.3
00:00:18.914 --> 00:00:24.309
Overdue, Due and Upcoming rows come first, in the order of their dates.

3.1
00:00:24.309 --> 00:00:28.822
Step 3. Open the record sheet from the row. Select Record dose.

3.2
00:00:28.822 --> 00:00:31.596
Care opens the Record immunization sheet,

3.3
00:00:31.596 --> 00:00:37.171
with the recommendation under For recommendation and its vaccine filled in.

4.1
00:00:37.171 --> 00:00:39.207
Step 4. Fill in the dose.

4.2
00:00:39.207 --> 00:00:45.067
Fill in the fields as for any immunization, here the dose, the route and the site.

4.3
00:00:45.067 --> 00:01:09.759
Keep Mark the recommendation as complete selected.

5.1
00:01:09.759 --> 00:01:14.192
Step 5. Save the immunization. Select Save immunization.

5.2
00:01:14.192 --> 00:01:19.422
Care shows Immunization recorded, the dose appears under Administered,

5.3
00:01:19.422 --> 00:01:22.761
and the recommendation shows Complete.
